<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Interactive Menus</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Create WhatsApp interactive list menus that pop up when a customer sends a trigger keyword. Customers tap a button to see a list of options, select one, and automatically receive a reply.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">How It Works — Example Flow</h5>
    <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mb-3">Below is a visual example of how the menu appears on WhatsApp:</p>

    <!-- Step 1: Customer sends keyword -->
    <div class="mb-3">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Step 1 — Customer sends trigger keyword</p>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#e5ddd5] p-4" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22><rect width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23e5ddd5%22/><circle cx=%2210%22 cy=%2210%22 r=%220.5%22 fill=%22%23d4cdc5%22/></svg>');">
        <!-- Incoming bubble (customer) -->
        <div class="flex justify-end mb-1">
          <div class="max-w-[75%] rounded-lg px-3 py-2 shadow-sm" style="background:#dcf8c6;">
            <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-800">menu</p>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 text-right mt-0.5">10:30 AM</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: System sends interactive list message -->
    <div class="mb-3">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-purple-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Step 2 — System sends interactive list message</p>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#e5ddd5] p-4" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22><rect width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23e5ddd5%22/><circle cx=%2210%22 cy=%2210%22 r=%220.5%22 fill=%22%23d4cdc5%22/></svg>');">
        <!-- Outgoing interactive message (system) -->
        <div class="flex justify-start">
          <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden" style="background:#fff;">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="px-3 pt-2.5">
              <p class="text-[12px] font-bold text-gray-900">Our Services</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Body -->
            <div class="px-3 py-1.5">
              <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Welcome! Please select an option from the menu below to learn more about our services.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Footer -->
            <div class="px-3 pb-2">
              <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Reply anytime for help</p>
              <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 text-right mt-0.5">10:30 AM</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Button -->
            <div class="border-t border-gray-200">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 py-2 cursor-default">
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#00a5f4]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 6.75h12M8.25 12h12m-12 5.25h12M3.75 6.75h.007v.008H3.75V6.75zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zM3.75 12h.007v.008H3.75V12zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm-.375 5.25h.007v.008H3.75v-.008zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0z" /></svg>
                <span class="text-[12px] font-medium text-[#00a5f4]">Menu</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Popup list appears -->
    <div class="mb-3">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Step 3 — Customer taps button, popup list appears</p>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#e5ddd5] p-4 relative" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22><rect width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23e5ddd5%22/><circle cx=%2210%22 cy=%2210%22 r=%220.5%22 fill=%22%23d4cdc5%22/></svg>');">
        <!-- Simulated popup list -->
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-[85%] rounded-xl bg-white shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-200">
          <!-- Popup header -->
          <div class="bg-[#075e54] px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-white">Our Services</span>
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-white/70" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
          </div>
          <!-- Section title -->
          <div class="px-4 pt-2.5 pb-1">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#075e54] uppercase tracking-wide">Options</p>
          </div>
          <!-- List items -->
          <div class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <div class="px-4 py-2.5 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-900">Check Balance</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">View your current account balance</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="px-4 py-2.5 flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#e7f8e9]">
              <div class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-[#25d366] flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#25d366]"></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-900">Make Payment</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">Pay bills or transfer funds</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="px-4 py-2.5 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-900">Talk to Agent</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">Connect with a support agent</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="px-4 py-2.5 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-900">Store Locator</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">Find the nearest branch</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[9px] text-center text-gray-500 mt-2 italic">Customer selects "Make Payment"</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: Auto-reply sent -->
    <div class="mb-1">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-green-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Step 4 — System sends automatic reply</p>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#e5ddd5] p-4" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22><rect width=%2220%22 height=%2220%22 fill=%22%23e5ddd5%22/><circle cx=%2210%22 cy=%2210%22 r=%220.5%22 fill=%22%23d4cdc5%22/></svg>');">
        <!-- Customer's selection shown -->
        <div class="flex justify-end mb-2">
          <div class="max-w-[75%] rounded-lg px-3 py-2 shadow-sm" style="background:#dcf8c6;">
            <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-800">Make Payment</p>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-500 text-right mt-0.5">10:31 AM</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- System auto-reply -->
        <div class="flex justify-start">
          <div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-lg px-3 py-2 shadow-sm" style="background:#fff;">
            <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">To make a payment, please visit our payment portal at portal.example.com or visit any of our branches. You can also call us at 1800-XXX-XXXX for assistance.</p>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 text-right mt-0.5">10:31 AM</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Menu Structure</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Header</strong> (optional) — Bold text at the top of the message (max 60 chars)</li>
      <li><strong>Body</strong> (required) — Main message text explaining the menu</li>
      <li><strong>Footer</strong> (optional) — Small text at the bottom (max 60 chars)</li>
      <li><strong>Button Label</strong> — Text on the button that opens the list (max 20 chars)</li>
      <li><strong>Items</strong> — 1 to 10 selectable options, each with a title (max 24 chars), optional description, and reply text</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Tips</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Use a simple trigger keyword like "menu", "help", or "services"</li>
      <li>Keep item titles short and descriptive</li>
      <li>You can add <strong>multiple trigger keywords</strong> (e.g. "hi", "hello", "enquiry") — any of them will trigger the menu</li>
      <li>Each trigger keyword is an <strong>exact match</strong> (case-insensitive)</li>
      <li>Menu triggers are checked <strong>before</strong> auto-reply rules</li>
      <li>You can also send menus manually from the Menus page to any conversation</li>
      <li>Deactivate a menu to stop it from triggering without deleting it</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">WhatsApp Limits</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Header text: max <strong>60</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Body text: max <strong>1024</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Footer text: max <strong>60</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Button label: max <strong>20</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Item title: max <strong>24</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Item description: max <strong>72</strong> characters</li>
      <li>Maximum <strong>10</strong> items per menu</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Must have at least 1 item"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Every menu needs at least one list item with a title and reply text.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Item title must be 24 characters or less"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">WhatsApp limits item titles to 24 characters. Shorten the title.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
